   "source": [
    "## 7. Analisis Fitur Penting per Posisi\n",
    "\n",
    "Kita latih model **Gradient Boosting per posisi** untuk melihat fitur mana yang paling berpengaruh terhadap performa di setiap posisi."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1600x1000 with 4 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Load ulang data dengan fitur lengkap\n",
    "df_full = pd.read_csv(TRAIN_PATH)\n",
    "df_full = df_full[df_full['Performance'] != '-']\n",
    "df_full = add_features(df_full)\n",
    "\n",
    "positions = ['Striker', 'Defender', 'Midfielder', 'Goalkeeper']\n",
    "scaler = StandardScaler()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(16, 10))\n",
    "fig.suptitle('Top 5 Fitur Paling Berpengaruh per Posisi\\n(Gradient Boosting Feature Importance)', fontsize=14)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, pos in enumerate(positions):\n",
    "    subset = df_full[df_full['Position'] == pos].copy()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if len(subset) < 10:\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "    \n",
    "    X_pos = subset.drop(['Name', 'Performance', 'Club', 'Nationality', 'Position'], axis=1)\n",
    "    y_pos = subset['Performance']\n",
    "    \n",
    "    model = GradientBoostingClassifier(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)\n",
    "    model.fit(X_pos, y_pos)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    importances = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "        'Feature'    : X_pos.columns,\n",
    "        'Importance' : model.feature_importances_\n",
    "    }).sort_values(by='Importance', ascending=False).head(5)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ax = axes[i // 2][i % 2]\n",
    "    sns.barplot(data=importances, x='Importance', y='Feature', \n",
    "                palette='viridis', hue='Feature', legend=False, ax=ax)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f'{pos} (n={len(subset)})')\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel('Relative Importance')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.subplots_adjust(top=0.88)\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Kesimpulan\n",
    "\n",
    "| Aspek | Hasil |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Model Terbaik** | Gradient Boosting dengan GridSearchCV |\n",
    "| **Akurasi Validasi** | ~79.5% |\n",
    "| **Fitur Kunci (Umum)** | `Tackle_Success_Rate`, `Shot_Accuracy`, `Goals_Per_App`, `Pass_Accuracy` |\n",
    "| **Catatan** | Pemain dengan Appearances = 0 tidak diprediksi (label: `-`) |\n",
    "\n",
    "Model ini dapat digunakan melalui web interface Gradio (`app.py`) untuk memprediksi performa pemain baru secara interaktif."
   ]
